  "content": "\n\n<p>此為 SlashBlade 與 Thaumcraft 的附加模組。</p>\n<p>你還記得「風神之劍」(Blade of the Zephyr) 嗎？現在它以嶄新的面貌回歸了。</p>\n<p>祝您遊玩愉快：')</p>\n<p>本模組的模型與貼圖來源如下：</p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp; R_Liu 重新製作了 Tainted Magic 的太刀模型。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp; Sange 模型取自 SlashBlade</p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp; Sange 模型貼圖由 Syameimaru Zheng 製作。<del></del></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>圖片：</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img style=\"border:0px #000000;text-align:left;color:#000;text-transform:none;text-indent:0px;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none\" src=\"https://i.loli.net/2018/05/06/5aef2496d6313.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"663\" height=\"276\"><img src=\"https://i.loli.net/2018/05/06/5aef249486c84.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"959\" height=\"500\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.loli.net/2018/05/06/5aef2490e3870.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.loli.net/2018/05/06/5aef248f7bff0.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"662\" height=\"372\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
